---
name: Onboard Cisco ASA logs via syslog TCP
description: |
  Receives Cisco Secure Firewall ASA logs over TCP syslog, newline-delimited or
  octet-counted, normalizes them to OCSF 1.9, and publishes them to the `ocsf`
  topic.
---

accept_tcp "0.0.0.0:1470" {
  // ASA writes headers without a hostname unless it logs a device ID.
  read_syslog accept_pri_only=true, raw_message=raw
}
// ASA writes local times without a zone, except in the RFC 5424 format.
cisco::asa::ocsf::normalize timezone="Europe/Berlin"
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
publish "ocsf"
